Dialogue: 3,0:00:08.35,0:00:10.64,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}老哥斯拉正蹦蹦跳跳
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.35,0:00:10.64,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Old Godzilla was hoppin' around
Dialogue: 3,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.69,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}把东京市区当成游乐场闹
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.69,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Tokyo City like a big playground
Dialogue: 3,0:00:12.69,0:00:14.68,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}突然蝙蝠侠从阴影里窜出
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.69,0:00:14.68,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When suddenly Batman burst from the shade
Dialogue: 3,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.64,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}反手一颗蝙蝠雷 炸得哥斯拉直呼哎哟
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.64,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And hit Godzilla with a Bat Grenade
Dialogue: 3,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.94,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哥斯拉火了 刚想发飙
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.94,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Godzilla got pissed and began to attack
Dialogue: 3,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.98,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}却被大鲨鱼奥尼尔一记盖帽
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.98,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But didn't expect to be blocked by Shaq
Dialogue: 3,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}奥尼尔正准备用“奥氏功夫”
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.22,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who proceeded to open up a can of Shaq Fu
Dialogue: 3,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}亚伦·卡特却突然凭空杀出来
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.18,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When Aaron Carter came out of the blue
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.18,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}(亚伦·卡特：后街男孩成员尼克·卡特的亲弟弟 当年美国最红的奶油小生歌手)
Dialogue: 3,0:00:25.18,0:00:27.28,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}逮着奥尼尔就是一顿乱锤
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.18,0:00:27.28,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And he started beating up Shaquille O'Neal
Dialogue: 3,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.34,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}结果俩人一起被蝙蝠车创成了饼
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.34,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then they both got flattened by the Batmobile
Dialogue: 3,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}蝙蝠车还没来得及开回老巢
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.62,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But before he could make it back to the Batcave
Dialogue: 3,0:00:31.62,0:00:33.46,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}林肯总统从坟里蹦了出来
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.62,0:00:33.46,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Abraham Lincoln popped out of his grave
Dialogue: 3,0:00:33.46,0:00:35.56,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从大高帽底下掏出一把AK-47
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.46,0:00:35.56,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And took an AK47 out from under his hat
Dialogue: 3,0:00:35.56,0:00:37.56,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哒哒哒哒 把蝙蝠侠送上了西天
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.56,0:00:37.56,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Blew Batman away with a rat-a-tat-tat
Dialogue: 3,0:00:37.56,0:00:39.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但打光了子弹 他撒丫子就跑
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.56,0:00:39.70,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But he ran out of bullets and he ran away
Dialogue: 3,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}因为擎天柱大哥正赶好来救场
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.12,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Because Optimus Prime came to save the day
Dialogue: 3,0:00:42.37,0:00:46.28,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的终极乱斗
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.37,0:00:46.28,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown... of Ultimate Destiny
Dialogue: 3,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.56,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好人坏人满天飞 爆炸火光看个够
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.56,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good guys, bad guys, and explosions... as far as the eye can see
Dialogue: 3,0:00:50.56,0:00:54.94,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最后只能活一个 到底是谁能笑到最后？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.56,0:00:54.94,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And only one will survive, I wonder who it will be
Dialogue: 3,0:00:54.94,0:00:59.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的终极乱斗
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.94,0:00:59.37,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown of Ultimate Destiny
Dialogue: 3,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.46,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}哥斯拉上去就给了擎天柱一口
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.46,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Godzilla took a bite out of Optimus Prime
Dialogue: 3,0:01:09.46,0:01:11.24,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}就像警犬麦格拉夫咬住罪犯不松口
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.46,0:01:11.24,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Like Scruff McGruff took a bite out of crime
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.46,0:01:11.24,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（麦格拉夫警犬：美国公益广告里穿风衣的卡通警犬，专门教小朋友“咬住犯罪不松口”）
Dialogue: 3,0:01:11.24,0:01:13.28,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}奥尼尔带着一身车胎印又回来了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.24,0:01:13.28,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And then Shaq came back covered in a tire track
Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.28,0:01:15.64,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但成龙突然跳到他背上发威了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.28,0:01:15.64,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Jackie Chan jumped out and landed on his back
Dialogue: 3,0:01:15.64,0:01:17.76,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}蝙蝠侠受了伤站都站不稳
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.64,0:01:17.76,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And Batman was injured, and trying to get steady
Dialogue: 3,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.76,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}亚伯拉罕·林肯带着砍刀回来了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.76,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}When Abraham Lincoln came back with a machete
Dialogue: 3,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.88,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}突然有个东西绊了他一跤
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.88,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But suddenly something caught his leg and he tripped
Dialogue: 3,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.98,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}原来是印第安纳·琼斯一鞭子把他放倒
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.98,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Indiana Jones took him out with his whip
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.98,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}(印第安纳·琼斯：又译”夺宝奇兵“ 找宝藏对抗纳粹的大学教授)
Dialogue: 3,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.94,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}他回头看见哥斯拉正想搞偷袭
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.94,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then he saw Godzilla sneaking up from behind
Dialogue: 3,0:01:25.94,0:01:28.26,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想掏枪却发现枪不知道丢哪里去
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.94,0:01:28.26,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And he reached for his gun which he just couldn't find
Dialogue: 3,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.46,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}原来蝙蝠侠偷了枪 开了一枪还打偏
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.46,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}'Cause Batman stole it and he shot and he missed
Dialogue: 3,0:01:30.46,0:01:32.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}成龙大哥一拳就把子弹挡上了天
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.46,0:01:32.40,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And Jackie Chan deflected it with his fist
Dialogue: 3,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.48,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}然后他跳到空中翻了个跟斗
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.48,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then he jumped in the air and did a summersault
Dialogue: 3,0:01:34.48,0:01:36.68,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}林肯那边正在尝试撑杆跳高
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.48,0:01:36.68,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}While Abraham Lincoln tried to pole vault
Dialogue: 3,0:01:36.68,0:01:38.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想跳到擎天柱身上 结果半空撞个正着
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.68,0:01:38.82,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Onto Optimus Prime, but they collided in the air
Dialogue: 3,0:01:38.82,0:01:41.14,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}接着都被爱心熊的眼神光波给射爆了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.82,0:01:41.14,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then they both got hit by a Care Bear Stare
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.82,0:01:41.14,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（爱心熊：美国著名的低幼动画熊，必杀技是用肚子发射粉红色的“爱心光波”）
Dialogue: 3,0:01:41.42,0:01:45.64,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的终极乱斗
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.42,0:01:45.64,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown... of Ultimate Destiny
Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.64,0:01:49.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好人坏人满天飞 爆炸火光看个够
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.64,0:01:49.80,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good guys, bad guys, and explosions... as far as the eye can see
Dialogue: 3,0:01:49.80,0:01:53.76,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最后只能活一个 到底是谁能笑到最后？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.80,0:01:53.76,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And only one will survive, I wonder who it will be
Dialogue: 3,0:01:54.10,0:01:57.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的……
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.10,0:01:57.35,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown...
Dialogue: 3,0:01:57.94,0:02:02.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}天使唱起了圣洁的赞歌
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.94,0:02:02.10,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Angels sang out... in immaculate chorus
Dialogue: 3,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.78,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}查克·诺里斯从天而降
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.78,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Down from the heavens... descended Chuck Norris
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.78,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（查克·诺里斯：美国动作演员，在欧美网络段子里是无敌的战力计量单位）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:06.08,0:02:09.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}使出一记能踢碎骨头的飞腿
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.08,0:02:09.82,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who delivered a kick which could shatter bones
Dialogue: 3,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}正中印第安纳·琼斯的裤裆
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.90,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Into the crotch of Indiana Jones
Dialogue: 3,0:02:14.50,0:02:18.33,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}琼斯倒在地上疼得打滚
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.50,0:02:18.33,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Who fell over on the ground, writhing in pain
Dialogue: 3,0:02:18.33,0:02:22.54,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}蝙蝠侠趁机变回了布鲁斯·韦恩
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.33,0:02:22.54,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}As Batman changed back into Bruce Wayne
Dialogue: 3,0:02:22.88,0:02:26.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但查克早已看穿他的小聪明
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.88,0:02:26.72,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But Chuck saw through his clever disguise
Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.72,0:02:31.26,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}用大腿夹爆了蝙蝠侠的脑袋瓜
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.72,0:02:31.26,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And he crushed Batman's head in between his thighs
Dialogue: 3,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.86,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}接着是灰袍甘道夫和白袍甘道夫
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.86,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then Gandalf the Grey and Gandalf the White and
Dialogue: 3,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}《巨蟒与圣杯》里的黑骑士
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.90,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}"Monty Python and the Holy Grail"'s Black Knight and
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.87,0:02:35.90,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（黑骑士：《巨蟒与圣杯》里的著名嘴硬怪，四肢被砍光了还坚持说是“皮外伤”）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:35.90,0:02:38.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}贝尼托·墨索里尼和蓝色恶魔
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.90,0:02:38.12,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Benito Mussolini and The Blue Meanie and
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.90,0:02:38.12,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（蓝色恶魔：披头士乐队动画电影《黄色潜水艇》里的反派，一群长相精神污染、讨厌音乐的蓝怪物）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.04,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}牛仔柯蒂斯和灯神詹比
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.04,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Cowboy Curtis and Jambi the Genie
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.04,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（牛仔柯蒂斯：美国怪诞儿童剧"Pee-wee's Playhouse"配角，扮演者是《黑客帝国》的墨菲斯）
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.04,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（灯神詹比：同一个儿童剧里的角色，是一个只有脑袋漂在盒子里的蓝色精灵）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:40.04,0:02:42.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}机械战警、终结者、柯克船长和达斯·维达
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.04,0:02:42.18,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Robocop, the Terminator, Captain Kirk, and Darth Vader
Dialogue: 3,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}卢盘、超人、再加上所有的恐龙战队队员
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.32,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Lo Pan, Superman, every single Power Ranger
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.32,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（卢盘：80年代Cult片《妖魔大闹唐人街》里的不死妖魔，造型很像清朝僵尸）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:44.32,0:02:46.38,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}比尔·普雷斯顿和西奥多·洛根
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.32,0:02:46.38,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Bill S. Preston and Theodore Logan
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.32,0:02:46.38,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（比尔和泰德：90年代电影角色，两个穿越时空的傻缺高中生，Ted的扮演者是基努·李维斯）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:46.38,0:02:48.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}斯波克、巨石强森、章鱼博士、还有胡克·霍根
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.38,0:02:48.32,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Spock, The Rock, Doc Ock, and Hulk Hogan
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.38,0:02:48.38,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（胡克·霍根：美国职业摔角界的祖师爷级人物，标志性动作是狂野地把自己的黄色背心撕烂）
Dialogue: 3,0:02:48.32,0:02:50.34,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}所有人闪电般凭空出现
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.32,0:02:50.34,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}All came out of nowhere lightning fast
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.26,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}对着查克·诺里斯的牛仔屁股就是一顿爆踹
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.26,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And they kicked Chuck Norris and his cowboy ass
Dialogue: 3,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.48,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是世上最血腥的战役
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.48,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was the bloodiest battle the world ever saw
Dialogue: 3,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.56,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}围观群众全都看傻了眼
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.56,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}With civilians looking on total awe
Dialogue: 3,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这仗打了一个世纪那么久
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.70,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The fight raged on for a century
Dialogue: 3,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}死伤无数 但到了最后
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.92,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Many lives were claimed, but eventually
Dialogue: 3,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}冠军依然挺立 其他人全都扑街
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.18,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The champion stood, the rest saw the better:
Dialogue: 3,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}穿着血迹斑斑毛衣的——罗杰斯先生
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.42,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Mr. Rogers in a bloodstained sweater
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.42,Default-#2,atg3,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}（罗杰斯先生：全美公认最温柔善良的儿童节目主持人，有传记片，推荐去看看）
Dialogue: 3,0:03:05.76,0:03:10.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的终极乱斗
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.76,0:03:10.02,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown... of Ultimate Destiny
Dialogue: 3,0:03:10.02,0:03:14.04,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}好人坏人满天飞 爆炸火光看个够
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.02,0:03:14.04,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Good guys, bad guys, and explosions... as far as the eye can see
Dialogue: 3,0:03:14.04,0:03:18.26,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}最后只能活一个 到底是谁能笑到最后？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.04,0:03:18.26,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And only one will survive, I wonder who it will be
Dialogue: 3,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.64,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的……
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.64,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.06,Default-L2,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.06,Default-L2-#1,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown...
