Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.42,0:03:25.28,Default-#1,atg2,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.47,0:03:27.09,Default-L2,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}这是终极宿命的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:27.09,Default-L2-#1,atg1,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is the Ultimate Showdown...
